pyrfc compatibility
-------------------
The pyrfcx distribution provides an import package named "pyrfc".
It reproduces the public API and the client behaviour of SAP's pyrfc 3.4 so
that existing programs run unchanged. It contains no pyrfc code.

Tests adapted from pyrfc
------------------------
The source repository contains test files that are adapted from the test
suite of pyrfc 3.4 (https://github.com/SAP/PyRFC):

    tests/compat/config.py
    tests/compat/test_client_config.py
    tests/compat/test_connection.py
    tests/compat/test_datatypes.py
    tests/compat/test_errors.py
